  priorRatioIntegral π (t + (s : ℝ)) n / priorRatioIntegral π t n

/-- The prior expectation `E(α^(t+s-1)) = ∫_0^∞ α^(t+s-1) π(α) dα`, valued in the
extended nonnegative reals (no moment condition is assumed). -/
