  ∫⁻ a in Set.Ioi (0 : ℝ), ENNReal.ofReal (a ^ (t + (s : ℝ) - 1) * π a)

/-- The constant `G = 4δ² / (ε^(t+β) · γ(t+β, ε log 2))` built from the reduced
A2 witness `(ε,δ,β)` with `0 < ε < 1` and the fixed `t`. -/
